@@ -28,8 +28,14 @@ matching nearest or linear min/mag filtering. Active float-depth formats,
 cubes/other dimensions, multiple mip levels, mismatched filters and
 TXB/TXL/TXD/TEXBEM/TXPBEM reject translation with a bounded diagnostic. The
 engine drops failed pipelines; the legacy Metal path also rejects these
-failures instead of its ordinary built-in shader fallback. Other standalone
-legacy backend paths still need to adopt the metadata API. Texture remapping,
+failures instead of its ordinary built-in shader fallback. Live D3D12 now
+connects supported sampled-unit descriptors, effective PSO identity and the
+UN-coordinate exclusion. It memoizes units whose fetches are all TEX/TXP; an
+unsupported layout or mixed unsupported fetch keeps that unit's previous raw
